        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-229 (ensure supplier quality &amp; product-safety verification.) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: DC Quality Inspector</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
